[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="PartAssembly" format=3]
; The pilgrim, built from parts (docs/art-direction.md, NieR): a slender android, dark with white trim,
; a swallowtail coat, a white braid and a lantern at the hip. Joints follow HumanoidBone; R is the near side (+Z).

